WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
<v Alice>Thanks for joining. Let's talk about the auth migration timeline.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.800
<v Bob>I think we should delay the provider switch until staging secrets are ready.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.400
<v Alice>Agreed. Let's also confirm we have rollback ready.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.200
<v Bob>I'll write the rollback runbook by Friday.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.800
<v Carol>One concern from the user side — the empty dashboard after signup is causing confusion.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.400
<v Alice>Good point. Let's open a separate ticket for the onboarding fix.
